' @guidance:
' Create or update the PlantUML diagram describing how files tagged with the
' @guidance marker are processed. This is a SEPARATE way of using Ghostwriter
' and is NOT part of the Act/episode functionality.
' Keep this diagram simple: a short linear flow with one decision point,
' minimal notes, and no swimlane color-partitions.

@startuml
title Ghostwriter - @guidance Tag File Processing (standalone mode, not an Act)

skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F5F7FA
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #4A6FA5
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3CD

start

:Scan files in the selected project scope;
:Select the next file and its extension reviewer;

if (Reviewer found and file has "@guidance:"?) then (yes)
  :Extract the guidance text;
  :Build and send the standalone guidance prompt;
  :Apply the response and record it in the guidance report;
  note right
    The "@guidance:" comment remains in the file.
  end note
else (no)
  :Skip file;
endif

stop

@enduml
